<p> <space dim="horizontal"/>  Frank, Rechtsanwalt und Notar. </p></div><lb/>
<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<div n="2" type="jAn"><figure/><p>Jn der vergangenen Woche<lb/>
